    "title": "pion/dtls: 29 injected faults to find without a test suite",
    "description": "A pinned checkout of the pion/dtls library has been altered by 29 single-line edits spread across connection setup, option encoding, retransmission bookkeeping and configuration validation. The agent receives the source tree with no test suite and only a behavioural report of what users observed: newest-version sessions that never open, session resumption that aborts, connection identifiers that vanish or duplicate, option payloads that no longer survive a write-then-read cycle, size limits that stop being enforced, verification callbacks that are ignored, and retransmission timers that collapse. It must restore the intended behaviour and name every function that was edited, localizing each defect from the observable symptom alone.",
